Package: plankannot
Type: Package
Title: Functional Annotation of Plankton Taxonomic Datasets
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Said", "Ahmed", role = "aut"),
      person("Mariangela", "Santorsola",
             email = "mariangela.santorsola@unipv.it",
             role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides tools for annotating user-prepared plankton taxonomy
    tables against bundled functional databases and generating abundance-
    weighted stacked bar plots and heatmaps for selected functional traits.
    Taxonomic assignments are supplied by the user. The package performs
    name-based matching against curated database records and does not infer
    taxonomic assignments.
